A comment opened mid-line %-- hides what follows
= not a heading
- not a list item
--% and the paragraph goes on.

A code span `%--` hides nothing:
= This heading survives

请注意*以下事项：
- 第一项*重要*
- 第二项

A stray $ sign at the end of a line
= The heading after it survives

A call #strong(text("left" +
- 1 + " right")) spans lines.
